{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y对人物动机和最终选择的交代有所压缩，尤其结尾没有X那样明确写出即使始终没有人亲近，他也愿意好好生活这一层。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的话语更短，重点放大加亮，感受提示又与音乐段落同步出现，观众比较容易先抓住人物当下的处境，再通过具体的声音、身体反应和情绪变化理解音乐。它在感受的细腻程度和音乐对应关系上明显胜过X，且没有因为信息多就变成单纯堆词。X的优势是人物心理因果交代得更充分，前后故事的连续性以及最终的自我和解也更完整；但综合扫屏体验、段落要点和感受的具体程度，我会选Y。</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f02327cc-8d62-464a-84b3-f30e5b870660", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T090233716362Z", "elapsed_seconds": 118.359, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T09:04:32.088097+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ddb856c55414c1f26bc1a6f98161327eac7cd768acd88e6d901d0892f24e04a4", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attach